<title>JAPAN: Brunswick to delist from Tokyo bourse Feb 1.</title>
<headline>Brunswick to delist from Tokyo bourse Feb 1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Brunswick Corp  7653.T would delist from the bourse's foreign section on February 1 upon the U.S. company's request.</p>
</text>
